{"seq":1,"slug":"compliance-cost-model","title":"WEEE/EPR 合规成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-compliance-cost/compliance-cost-model","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"weee-epr-合规成本模型\">WEEE/EPR 合规成本模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把 WEEE/EPR 合规当成「每年给 PRO 交一笔环保费」，是跨境卖家最容易犯的成本建模错误——因为<strong>那笔钱只是整条成本链的最末端一段</strong>。真正的合规成本是一个<strong>由法定义务触发的多层成本叠加</strong>：注册费是准入门槛，申报是计量动作，PRO 费用是经济折算，逆向物流与危废处置是物理成本，授权代表与财务担保是结构成本，罚则则是模型里的尾部风险。任何一层缺席，成本都不会消失，只会以「产品下架」「补缴 + 罚款」「整批货物卡关」的形式反弹回来。</p>\n<p>理解成本模型的关键，是先分清<strong>哪些成本随销量线性增长、哪些是固定沉没、哪些是阈值触发</strong>。PRO 费用按重量/台数线性放大，是唯一随规模同比例变化的层；注册费、代表年费、系统接入是一次性固定成本，规模越大摊得越薄；罚款与追溯补缴则是「平时为零、触发时悬崖式上升」的尾部项。义务主体识别决定这些成本落在谁头上，判定规则见 <a href=\"../endoflife-obligation-subject/epr-producer-obligation-model\">EPR 生产者责任延伸义务模型</a>——<strong>成本模型的第一步不是算钱，而是确认你是不是那个要付钱的人</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个校准过的整体口径：PRO 收费的核心变量是<strong>投放重量</strong>而非销售额。欧委会环境总署披露 2022 年欧盟投放市场的电子电器设备约 <strong>14.4 百万吨</strong>，而 WEEE 收费正是按重量 × 品类费率计征（欧盟委员会 WEEE 专题页，environment.ec.europa.eu）。这意味着成本建模的输入是<strong>每 SKU 的净重与品类，而非价格</strong>——一款轻薄的充电器与一台沉重的显示器，售价可能相同，合规成本却相差两个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本层级分解\">成本层级分解</h2><p>合规成本不是单一科目，而是七层可分别建模、分别优化的成本。建模错的团队通常只算了第 3 层。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>计征方式</th>\n<th>规模弹性</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>注册与登记</td>\n<td>每法域/每品牌一次性或年费</td>\n<td>固定（随规模摊薄）</td>\n<td>首次投放前必须先注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>定期申报</td>\n<td>申报服务/系统接入 + 数据维护</td>\n<td>半固定</td>\n<td>按季度/年度周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>PRO 参与费</td>\n<td>投放重量 × 品类费率 × 生态调节系数</td>\n<td><strong>线性</strong></td>\n<td>每批投放市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>逆向物流</td>\n<td>集货、运输、仓储、危货单证</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>报废/退货处置时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>危废处置</td>\n<td>去污取出的危废单独处置</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>含汞/含铅/电池等部件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>授权代表（AR）</td>\n<td>每法域年费 + 代理申报服务</td>\n<td>半固定</td>\n<td>非欧盟主体须委任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>合规风险</td>\n<td>罚款、追溯补缴、下架损失</td>\n<td>尾部（悬崖式）</td>\n<td>申报不实/未注册被查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里最反直觉的是<strong>第 4、5 层常被遗漏</strong>。PRO 费只覆盖「你委托系统去处理的量」，一旦实际报废量超过你申报并支付的量，超出部分的处置由谁买单，取决于回收网络的实际运作——渠道结构如何决定废弃产品最终在哪国被接住，见 <a href=\"../waste-collection-network/takeback-channel-network-model\">回收渠道与回收点网络模型</a>。含电池、含灯管的产品还会在第 5 层额外产生危废流，去污取出的这部分<strong>不进回收效率分子，却按危废计价</strong>，单位成本往往远高于普通回收费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pro-费率结构与生态调节\">PRO 费率结构与生态调节</h2><p>第 3 层是成本的大头，也是唯一能通过<strong>产品设计</strong>去优化的层。它的计征公式在各国 PRO 之间高度同构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>PRO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{PRO}} = \\sum_{i} w_i \\times r_{c,i} \\times m_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PRO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 SKU 计入申报的净重（kg 或台数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{c,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该品类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的基础费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是生态调节（eco-modulation）系数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{c,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由品类决定——温控设备、屏幕、小型 IT 通信设备的回收难度与危废含量不同，费率逐级递增；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 则是近年的监管创新：可回收性差、含危废部件、不可拆解的产品被乘以大于 1 的系数，绿色设计的产品被乘以小于 1 的系数，从而把「末端处置成本」前移成「设计激励」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SKU 台账&lt;br/&gt;净重 + 品类 + 材质] --&gt; B{品类映射}&#10;    B --&gt; C[品类基础费率 r_c]&#10;    A --&gt; D{生态调节评估}&#10;    D --&gt; E[调节系数 m_i&lt;br/&gt;可回收性/危废/可拆解]&#10;    C --&gt; F[C_PRO = Σ w_i × r_c × m_i]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[+ 注册/申报固定费]&#10;    F --&gt; H[+ 逆向物流 + 危废]&#10;    G --&gt; I[法域合规总成本]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[摊入单位成本&lt;br/&gt;C_unit = C_total / N_units]\">graph TD\n    A[SKU 台账&lt;br/&gt;净重 + 品类 + 材质] --&gt; B{品类映射}\n    B --&gt; C[品类基础费率 r_c]\n    A --&gt; D{生态调节评估}\n    D --&gt; E[调节系数 m_i&lt;br/&gt;可回收性/危废/可拆解]\n    C --&gt; F[C_PRO = Σ w_i × r_c × m_i]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[+ 注册/申报固定费]\n    F --&gt; H[+ 逆向物流 + 危废]\n    G --&gt; I[法域合规总成本]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[摊入单位成本&lt;br/&gt;C_unit = C_total / N_units]</pre><p>生态调节体系已从概念走向强制：法国 AGEC 体系下的 EPR 生态调节（éco-modulation）多年按可修复性、可回收性、是否含危废给予正向或负向调节；欧盟层面 <strong>PPWR (EU) 2025/40</strong> 自 <strong>2026-08-12</strong> 适用，把包装 EPR 的生态调节写入法规。对电子电器而言，虽然 WEEE 指令 2012/19/EU 本身未强制生态调节，但成员国与 PRO 越来越多地自行引入——<strong>这意味着同一款产品在不同法域的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能不同</strong>，成本模型必须按法域分别参数化，而不能用一张全球费率表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位经济-把合规成本摊到每一台\">单位经济：把合规成本摊到每一台</h2><p>对电商定价真正有意义的不是法域总额，而是<strong>单位成本</strong>，因为最终它要回到产品价格里。定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>logi</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>hw</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>units</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit}} = \\frac{C_{\\text{fixed}} + \\sum_i w_i \\times r_{c,i} \\times m_i \\times N_i + C_{\\text{logi}} + C_{\\text{hw}}}{N_{\\text{units}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">units</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">logi</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fixed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（注册 + 申报 + AR 年费）除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>units</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{units}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">units</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后随销量下降，构成规模经济；而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i r_{c,i} m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项是<strong>每台的边际成本，不随规模下降</strong>。这解释了一个常见现象：小卖家觉得「合规贵到没法做」，大卖家却能靠薄利多销——不是大卖家有折扣，而是固定层被摊薄了，而边际层对两者是同一套费率。</p>\n<p>建模时必须区分两类 SKU。<strong>轻型高值品</strong>（耳机、手机配件）单位重量小、售价高，合规成本占售价比通常低于 1%，可近似忽略，是「合规友好型」。<strong>重型低值品</strong>（大屏显示器、家电）重量大、费率所属品类高，合规成本占售价可能达到可观比例，一款产品的合规成本足以吃掉本就微薄的毛利。这就是为什么成熟的跨境团队在产品立项阶段就把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为<strong>准入判据</strong>，而不是等到上市后才被动接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建模与敏感性分析\">建模与敏感性分析</h2><p>一个可运行的合规成本模型需要四个输入表 + 一次敏感性扫描。四个输入表是：<strong>SKU 台账</strong>（净重、品类、材质、是否含电池/灯管）、<strong>法域参数表</strong>（各国费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、调节规则、固定费、AR 年费）、<strong>物流参数表</strong>（集货/运输/仓储单价、危废处置单价）、<strong>销量预测</strong>（分法域、分品类的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。前三张表都是外部给定的参数，只有销量是你可以主动优化的变量——因此成本模型的价值不在算出一个数，而在<strong>回答「哪个法域的哪个品类在边际上不可行」</strong>。</p>\n<p>敏感性分析应至少扫三个维度。<strong>重量</strong>是最敏感变量，因为它在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>PRO</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{PRO}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PRO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里是一阶项；一款产品减重 10% 若不影响品类，PRO 费近似同比例下降。<strong>生态调节系数</strong>是政策敏感变量，近年趋势单调向上，建模时应对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取进取值而非乐观值。<strong>报废率</strong>决定第 4、5 层是否被低估——逆向物流与危废的实际发生量取决于渠道结构，回收渠道的单位成本捕获能力直接进入总成本，渠道组合的优化本身就是降本动作，见 <a href=\"../waste-collection-network/takeback-channel-network-model\">回收渠道与回收点网络模型</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SKU 台账] --&gt; M[成本模型]&#10;    B[法域费率参数] --&gt; M&#10;    C[物流/危废单价] --&gt; M&#10;    D[销量预测] --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; E[法域合规总额 C_total]&#10;    M --&gt; F[单位成本 C_unit]&#10;    E --&gt; G[敏感性扫描&lt;br/&gt;重量/调节系数/报废率]&#10;    F --&gt; H{占售价比是否超阈值?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[重新设计 / 换品类 / 放弃法域]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[纳入定价]\">graph TD\n    A[SKU 台账] --&gt; M[成本模型]\n    B[法域费率参数] --&gt; M\n    C[物流/危废单价] --&gt; M\n    D[销量预测] --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; E[法域合规总额 C_total]\n    M --&gt; F[单位成本 C_unit]\n    E --&gt; G[敏感性扫描&lt;br/&gt;重量/调节系数/报废率]\n    F --&gt; H{占售价比是否超阈值?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[重新设计 / 换品类 / 放弃法域]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[纳入定价]</pre><h2 id=\"常见建模错误\">常见建模错误</h2><p><strong>错误一：只算 PRO 费。</strong> 第 1、2、6 层的固定成本在小规模时占比极高，一个只做几万欧元 GMV 的卖家，注册 + AR + 申报的年费可能超过其 PRO 费本身。遗漏固定层会系统性低估小卖家的负担。</p>\n<p><strong>错误二：用一套费率套所有法域。</strong> 费率、品类分组、生态调节规则、是否强制 AR、是否需要财务担保，各国差异巨大。跨法域成本必须<strong>分法域建表</strong>，套装规则属于典型反模式。</p>\n<p><strong>错误三：把 PRO 费当作唯一成本而忽略追溯风险。</strong> 申报不实的暴露不是「多交一点」，而是追溯补缴加罚款的尾部项。义务主体错位（比如把进口商身份误判为分销商）会让所有下游数字失效，识别判断见 <a href=\"../endoflife-obligation-subject/epr-registration-authorized-representative\">EPR 注册与授权代表机制</a>——<strong>主体错了，成本模型的分母就是错的</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>错误四：静态快照而非滚动预测。</strong> EPR 费率与调节规则逐年上调（收集率达标压力驱动，见 <a href=\"../treatment-recycling-data/recycling-rate-data-accounting\">回收率与处置数据核算方法</a>），把当期费率当常数外推三年，会低估中长期成本。成熟做法是对费率设年化增长假设，纳入滚动预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>合规成本模型的要点可以压缩成四条可立即落地的判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分层建模</strong>：七层成本（注册、申报、PRO 费、逆向物流、危废、授权代表、合规风险）分法域分品类建表，只算 PRO 费是最常见的低估来源。</li>\n<li><strong>区分弹性</strong>：固定层随规模摊薄，边际层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i r_{c,i} m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）不随规模下降——小卖家贵在固定层，重型低值品贵在边际层。</li>\n<li><strong>动态参数</strong>：费率与生态调节系数逐年上调，建模须取进取值并按法域分别参数化，禁止用一张全球费率表套所有市场。</li>\n<li><strong>前置判据</strong>：把单位合规成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为产品立项与法域扩张的准入判据，让每次费率更新都能一键重算，而不是年末被动补账。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把四张输入表（SKU 台账、法域参数、物流单价、销量预测）固化成一个可重跑的脚本或配置，让每次产品立项、每次法域扩张、每次费率更新都能一键重算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这才是合规成本模型的工程形态，而不是一张一年一填的 Excel。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WEEE/EPR 合规成本模型","id":"weee-epr-合规成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本层级分解","id":"成本层级分解"},{"level":2,"text":"PRO 费率结构与生态调节","id":"pro-费率结构与生态调节"},{"level":2,"text":"单位经济：把合规成本摊到每一台","id":"单位经济-把合规成本摊到每一台"},{"level":2,"text":"建模与敏感性分析","id":"建模与敏感性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"常见建模错误","id":"常见建模错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/treatment-vendor-qualification-evidence"},"next":{"title":"EPR 申报与费用结算机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-compliance-cost/epr-reporting-fee-settlement"}}